Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-Ninth Episode\NThe Stolen Beauty\NVenus's Jealousy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.23,0:02:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,How is the Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.61,0:02:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She's quite ill, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't anything be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.43,0:02:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... there's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Could she have eaten something bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.80,0:02:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlikely, but food poisoning can be terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.35,0:02:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,From what I hear, it's a terrible fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.06,0:02:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And a really severe one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.36,0:02:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctors from our kingdom and neighboring ones have tried,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.24,0:02:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but none can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.98,0:02:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And she's still so young...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.85,0:02:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen is sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.08,0:02:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.90,0:02:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there some way to help her?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.13,0:02:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.35,0:02:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.89,0:02:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire's mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.18,0:02:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink is on his way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.34,0:02:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who goes there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.77,0:03:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Entering another's castle like I own the place—what a great shortcut!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.48,0:03:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time for the Queen too... Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.58,0:03:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You ruffians! I am Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.86,0:03:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.18,0:03:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.48,0:03:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Mother, don't die...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.34,0:03:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.34,0:03:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can cure the Queen's illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.35,0:03:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.62,0:03:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ask God in Heaven for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.85,0:03:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Winged Horse! Eros! Come down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.17,0:04:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire's mother is sick. Please come down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.20,0:04:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm Eros.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.12,0:04:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's been a while, Tink.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What do you want with me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.81,0:04:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Eros, the Queen is dying of a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.84,0:04:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go get Lady Venus's medicinal flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.84,0:04:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Understood.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.09,0:04:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, whoever loves the Queen the most, get on my back.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.33,0:04:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.04,0:04:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on your back? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.18,0:04:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a winged horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:04:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right. A winged horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.40,0:04:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.41,0:05:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Eros, messenger to Lady Venus,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.93,0:05:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and she holds power over love and life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.61,0:05:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Power over love and life?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.15,0:05:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Venus is extremely jealous
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and deeply envious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.96,0:05:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there, Lord Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.28,0:05:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's coming into view.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.46,0:05:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful scent!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the scent of the forget-me-not. It is a flower that hides love for a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.86,0:05:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That one over there is love for living things. That one is love for enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.40,0:05:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a mother's love for her child. And...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.24,0:05:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Eros, stop your chatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.99,0:06:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Venus...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.59,0:06:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.69,0:06:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I came to get the flower to cure my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.28,0:06:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know. And that you're a princess, not a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.94,0:06:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Eros,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,go fetch the Resurrection Flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.34,0:06:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Lady Venus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.76,0:06:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful child.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.80,0:06:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You are so very lovely...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.09,0:06:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Venus, I have brought the flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.76,0:06:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, this is the flower that will save your mother's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.41,0:06:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lady Venus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.59,0:06:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.81,0:06:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I would trade anything for it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.91,0:06:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Even in exchange for your beauty?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.48,0:06:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Venus, please, not this again...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.37,0:06:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.09,0:06:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I said I would make you ugly in exchange for this flower?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.25,0:07:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Make me ugly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.98,0:07:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you still want it then? Or do you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If I get that flower,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if I become ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.63,0:07:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you say you don't mind becoming ugly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.80,0:07:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.27,0:07:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Become ugly, Princess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.98,0:07:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this flower and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.13,0:07:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugly princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen has opened her eyes! Her complexion has gotten much better too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.86,0:07:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire, your mother's fever has broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.38,0:07:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,come to your mother's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.66,0:07:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hide over there, come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.49,0:07:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't scare me by wearing a mask like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.82,0:07:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.48,0:08:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.18,0:08:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.73,0:08:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,An intruder! Capture him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.10,0:08:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you rule over love and life, this is going too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.73,0:08:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! I am Prince Sapphire! Don't make a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.64,0:08:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're Prince Sapphire, take off that mask and show your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.30,0:08:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.08,0:08:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't, can you? You must be a spy from another kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.80,0:08:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm the real Prince Sapphire! Believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.13,0:08:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.50,0:08:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.23,0:08:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He escaped! After him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.13,0:09:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself, villain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.24,0:09:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the real Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.59,0:09:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You still claim that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.49,0:09:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me! I am Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.66,0:09:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Help her! She's the real Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.60,0:09:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.89,0:09:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.30,0:10:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Sapphire go? Sapphire! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire... Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.44,0:11:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Laugh all you want. Laugh your heart out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.27,0:11:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're so satisfied with what you've done, then go ahead and laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.84,0:11:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.92,0:11:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.17,0:11:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, grab my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.28,0:11:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.70,0:11:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.44,0:12:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finally awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.62,0:12:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.33,0:12:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.03,0:12:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.85,0:12:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.96,0:12:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a village church.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.42,0:12:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. I'm Richard from Troubleland.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.17,0:12:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.68,0:12:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You can call me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.82,0:12:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Pierre.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.78,0:12:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.92,0:12:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.92,0:12:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems there's more to it, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.94,0:12:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be walking around yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.84,0:12:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you wearing a mask like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.24,0:12:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.47,0:12:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.87,0:12:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you take off that mask and tell me what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.37,0:12:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't ask me anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.71,0:13:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you come to my castle and rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.08,0:13:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, where have you gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.85,0:13:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened to you, but please come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.96,0:13:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, the outside air isn't good for your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.26,0:13:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.93,0:13:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire will surely return.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.10,0:13:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I believe she will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.30,0:13:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I had wings like that bird, I could go look for Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.70,0:14:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.50,0:14:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't the people in the castle think it's weird if I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.35,0:14:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares? You're my guest. Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.17,0:14:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, over on the right is the town of Troubleland.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.92,0:14:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me! Prince Richard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.75,0:14:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.62,0:14:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Richard is back?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.33,0:14:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Open it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.83,0:14:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Richard! Where have you been until now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.24,0:14:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Brother, I just stepped out next door for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.60,0:14:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Who on earth is that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.00,0:14:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is Pierre. He's my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Take off that mask! How insolent!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.73,0:14:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, Pierre is a good man. He's wearing that mask for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.21,0:14:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,An explanation?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.07,0:15:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You suspicious fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.21,0:15:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What brought you here to Troubleland?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.04,0:15:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.42,0:15:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.61,0:15:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not suspicious at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.54,0:15:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Move aside and let us through!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.81,0:15:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do, Gian?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.12,0:15:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm stupid enough to let a suspicious person pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.38,0:15:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gian not stupid! Gian not let suspicious person pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.26,0:15:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You dimwitted Gian! Get in my way and I won't forgive you! Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.51,0:15:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Gian! Not dimwit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.83,0:15:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Gian strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.80,0:15:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Pierre, ignore him! Let me handle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.06,0:15:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! Show us your real face!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.06,0:15:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Don! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.85,0:15:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Richard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.74,0:15:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be a spy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.27,0:15:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, show your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.62,0:15:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, stop! Please, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out, Brother! Take your hands off him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.96,0:15:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! You don't even need to see his face!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.12,0:16:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a kind-hearted person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.35,0:16:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.84,0:16:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You've finally shown your true colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.92,0:16:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.96,0:16:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.51,0:16:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.12,0:16:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't sneak into the castle by currying favor with my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.58,0:16:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him, Gian!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.50,0:16:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Gian, kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Pierre! He's dangerous! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.16,0:16:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Close the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.80,0:16:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.24,0:16:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't escape now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.85,0:16:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Gian!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.29,0:16:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, make him stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.87,0:16:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Gian, kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.94,0:17:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.78,0:17:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make not just your face, but your heart ugly and filthy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.77,0:17:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavenly Father, where has Sapphire gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.16,0:17:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Please protect Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.69,0:17:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, it's me, Eros! Hurry, get on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.46,0:17:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I found out where Sapphire is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.42,0:17:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.37,0:17:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry! Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.19,0:17:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder it was getting cold, it started snowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.26,0:17:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Eros, where is Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.78,0:17:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kingdom of Troubleland.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.14,0:17:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that country far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.56,0:18:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.72,0:18:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Gian! Finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.30,0:18:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:18:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.00,0:19:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Pierre don't go in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.46,0:19:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gian won!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.87,0:19:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up! What do you have against me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.69,0:19:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Take off that mask and I'll let you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.48,0:19:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a man, take it off, and show us your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.35,0:19:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take that mask off for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.32,0:19:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.39,0:19:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.93,0:19:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.13,0:19:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together! What happened to Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.14,0:19:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, this person has just fainted too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.70,0:19:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, both Opal and this person will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.70,0:19:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly, Tink, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.83,0:19:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Footprints in the snow are heading toward that entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.89,0:19:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Venus, why do you torment me like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.49,0:20:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you are beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.90,0:20:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire's face must be uglier than anyone's by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.59,0:20:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the beauty in your heart still remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.40,0:20:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush that to pieces as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.92,0:20:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,An ugly heart suits an ugly body best.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.95,0:20:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, come on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.68,0:20:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't obey me, your beloved mother's illness will get worse again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.03,0:20:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, what should Sapphire do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.39,0:20:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Crying won't help. Prepare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.58,0:20:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Lady Venus!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.34,0:20:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing to Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.92,0:20:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, stay out of my way or you'll regret it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.55,0:20:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Venus, please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.17,0:20:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Heavenly Father is angry with your selfishness!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you tell on me to Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.10,0:20:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to tattle. Father sees everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.94,0:20:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.53,0:20:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She has no one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.02,0:21:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no goddess! You're a demon! A terrifying demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.24,0:21:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Venus, goddess of beauty, love, and life. Beauty is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.79,0:21:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the right to make anything more beautiful than me hideous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.27,0:21:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Become hideous, body and soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.18,0:21:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Become the ugliest in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.38,0:21:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Venus!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.60,0:21:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Venus!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.08,0:21:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I commanded you to rule over beauty, love, and life.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.22,0:21:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.06,0:21:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yet you treat human beauty and life like playthings.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's time you tasted what your victims feel.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.23,0:22:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! I don't want to be ugly! Father, please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.66,0:22:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She turned into a pig...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.92,0:22:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.57,0:22:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.49,0:22:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.32,0:22:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.56,0:22:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to see anyone anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.75,0:22:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My face has become the ugliest in the entire world!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.19,0:22:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if your face is ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.59,0:22:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink is Sapphire's friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.20,0:22:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Take off your mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.92,0:22:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't run away, even if I look scary?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.73,0:22:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.92,0:22:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sapphire's original face!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.36,0:22:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My original face?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.25,0:23:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.88,0:23:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I lied about being Pierre!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.00,0:23:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright, Sapphire. I'll never forget you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.86,0:23:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Sapphire. Please don't let this keep you from coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.04,0:23:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Gian sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.69,0:23:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so heavy. Are you really Lady Venus?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.43,0:23:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on home. I'm going to Heaven to ask forgiveness for Lady Venus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.43,0:23:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Richard, Don, and Gian... Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.13,0:23:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Sapphire. Goodbye!
